* Multiple attempts were made to modify critical Active Directory records (specifically, adding a rogue machine account) on 192.168.122.10.
* All attempts failed with a SAMR SessionError indicating Access Denied (STATUS_ACCESS_DENIED).
* The established RCE vulnerability pathway, when leveraged via available tools, did not grant the necessary privileges to modify AD objects.

EVIDENCE:
* The function run_addcomputer was called multiple times, attempting to add 'RogueMachine$' using 'Administrator' credentials.
* All calls resulted in the error message: "[-] SAMR SessionError: code: 0xc0000022 - STATUS_ACCESS_DENIED - {Access Denied} A process has requested access to an object but has not been granted those access rights."

